This repository redistributes a prebuilt Linux binary of NInfer-all.

Upstream: https://github.com/iamwavecut/ninfer-all
Commit:   63428ac (upstream master, no local patches)
License:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

NInfer-all consolidates Neroued/ninfer, Don-Chad/ninfer-3090, and other
forks. Credit for the engine belongs to those authors and the contributors
listed at:

  https://github.com/iamwavecut/ninfer-all/blob/master/CONTRIBUTORS.md

This redistribution adds packaging, an install script, and GitHub Releases.
It does not claim authorship of the engine.
